# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored — never commit a real token.
#
# This file is the source of truth: it overrides any GITHUB_TOKEN already
# exported in your shell. Plain unquoted values only — surrounding quotes would
# become part of the token, and `#` or `$` in a value need escaping.
#
# GitHub personal access token, Settings -> Developer settings -> Personal
# access tokens -> Fine-grained tokens. Minimum scope: contents:write on
# kjrocker/pglantern-cli (create releases, upload assets).
GITHUB_TOKEN=
